// Terminate (T3, Eliminate/Annihilate tree), author: alphy. Kitbash: beam-weapon wings, spiroct fins, point-defense spine,
// heal-shotgun nose, reversed artillery-mount shoulder pods (serpulo). Flyer, speed 0.8, flare-style circle-attack AI (circleTarget).
// Dashes (mounts 0-2): forward impulse 0.7/tick for 0.3 s along the facing (bullet recoil -0.7; ~75 wu dash + glide ~150 wu total, = v24 x6.3).
// No speed status any more: it multiplied AI steering and turn rate x6.3, so circle-attack turned 180 deg away from air targets mid-dash.
// AI aims at the target itself (predictTarget false; the 0.01-speed bullet broke the intercept) and only dashes within 10 deg.
// Attack = Spearhead shrapnel lance, smaller (len 70, 1 serration, no lightning) every tick of the dash, base 1.5 wu ahead of centre
// (just past the wings): cosmetic (0 dmg); the dash bullet deals the damage every 3rd tick: 26.61 per hit, ~6 hits = ~160 per dash at 0 armor (v32 -20%, v33 +10%)
// (v31: armor counts 6x per dash instead of 18x; vs armor 9 ~106 per dash). High-flying (lance drawn below). Whole nose heats per dash.
// AI: singleTarget (dash mounts track the main target every tick; vanilla per-mount retarget every 1.5 s made it dash ~4x less).
// 0.2 s between dashes (start-to-start 0.5 s), 2 s recharge after the 3rd. Tap = 1 dash, hold 0.5 s = 2, hold 1 s = 3. AI fires within 7 tiles.
// Nozzles (mounts 12-13, build-beam sprites on the wing roots): automatic, not player/AI controlled. Alternating, 1 shot per 1.5 s:
// 3 lightning bolts (length 7 = ~42 wu reach) in random directions x 33 dmg = 99 per shot (66 DPS if all bolts land; v32 -20%, v33 +10%).
// Strain (mounts 3-11): 9 stacks over 24 s of firing, x0.85724 speed + reload each (x0.25 at 9), no damage, 6 s duration; lerp warmup memory.
